From 764c177c0e84cc387e867333715078a082d70461 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: faycal <faycalelhandi9@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:55:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/26] feat(agc): compute-lane batches on a second Vulkan
 queue (APS5_COMPUTE_QUEUE)

With APS5_COMPUTE_LANE on, APS5_COMPUTE_QUEUE creates one more queue in the
graphics family and submits compute-lane batches to it. A batch whose lane
differs from the previous batch waits on the recorder timeline for that
batch, and the present blit waits for the newest batch, so execution order
is unchanged. Device idles also idle the compute queue.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
