 | `APS5_COMPUTE_LANE` | presence | `core/libs/prx/libSceAgcDriver/Graphics/src/Recorder.cpp` |  | lane-separated batches: queue workers 0x40 and 0x48 record into compute-lane batches and every other thread into graphics-lane batches; when a thread of the other lane records, the open batch is submitted first, so each batch holds one lane's work in the original order (groundwork for a separate compute queue); an empty value or one starting with `0` leaves it off |
